  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ending Violence against Women and Girls - Guatemala</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims to strengthen mechanisms to tackle VAWG across the whole continuum from prevention and protection to response. Primary and secondary VAWG prevention is a key objective. In Guatemala, partners will strengthen the knowledge and capacity indigenous and mestizo women on VAWG, so that they can influence their communities and denounce cases and promote strategies for the prevention of violence.</narrative>
  </description>
